---
description: Model selection for document scanning and text integrations.
alwaysApply: true
---

Do not select GPT-4o-mini, or a dated version of it, except as a backup after Gemini. Those backups are lease extraction in `documentProvider.ts` and equipment photos in `equipmentRequest.ts`. Do not use it for SMS, classification, or any other path.

Document extraction uses Gemini 3.8 Flash (`gemini-3.8-flash`) first. Difficult lease sections and hard-to-read equipment labels fall back to `gpt-4o-mini`. SMS classification, description cleanup, and inbound intent use `gpt-6-luna`. Ask Ulo uses `gpt-6-sol`. Other existing OpenAI text helpers stay on `gpt-4o`. These paths do not call Anthropic. Keep model IDs and provider audit metadata aligned with the actual request.

Read the complete uploaded lease. Do not silently cap extraction to a first-page preview. Preserve page evidence and distinguish absent terms from unreadable or conflicting fields. Only supported, confident fields may populate imported records; preserve existing rent-roll precedence.
